  This port reimplements FModel's features and interface for macOS with Avalonia, and reuses its
  resources: the icons in app/FModel/Assets/Icons, the syntax definitions in
  app/FModel/Assets/Highlighting and the vector icons in app/FModel/Themes/Icons.axaml
  (generated from FModel's Icons.xaml).

