Web services the app can reach: GitHub's API (api.github.com), at launch, to check this project's releases for
updates (Help › Releases › Remind Me › Never turns it off), and, when the user uses those features, uedb.dev (AES
keys and mappings presets) and FModel's backup service (export-service-new.dillyapis.com). The app identifies
itself to them as "FModel-macOS".
